enc: WCon Move [WRec [(x, WInt 1), (y, WInt (-2))], WList [WInt 3, WInt 4]]
dec: Ok Move {x = 1, y = -2} [3, 4] | Ok Pair (7, seven) | Ok Bump 10
bad: Err Bump field 1: not a number | Err Msg: no such message: Nope | Err Move field 1: y: missing | Err expected a message: [name, field, ...]
field: WList [WRec [(name, WStr a), (tags, WList [WStr p, WStr q]), (at, WRec [(x, WInt 1), (y, WInt 2)]), (done, WBool True)]]
back: Ok [{at = {x = 1, y = 2}, done = True, name = a, tags = [p, q]}] | Err 0: tags: 1: expected a string
